    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d343-a5">

                <pb facs="0605" n="543" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg543"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    662.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Important communications.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[From Diario Oficial, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1878-01-16">January 16,
                        1878</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>In the official column our readers will see the communications addressed by the
                    department of foreign affairs to that of war, and also to General Treviño, in
                    relation to the passage of American troops to our territory. The executive is
                    resolved to make a severe example of the officer who may have failed to obey the
                    instructions which should control the conduct of the forces which guard the
                    frontier.</p>
            </div>
